"The Oracle ordered Themiel to search the Cursed City and make friends there."
"If that fails, his orders are to go on to the Black Pyre by way of the Broken Fang."
"The Oracle's word to him was \"Friends, not enemies.\""
"The Oracle once saw Themiel dragged away screaming in a vision."
"Themiel once told the Oracle of a possible transmigrator at the Bloody Peaks."
